{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you park perfectly?</strong><br>Put your driving precision to the ultimate test in this fun and challenging car parking game. Navigate tight spaces, dodge obstacles, and master smooth, realistic driving controls as you guide your car into the perfect spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.mp4?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet suburban lots to busy city streets and multi-level garages, every level offers a new challenge that will test your steering skills and timing. Squeeze through narrow gaps, avoid collisions, and earn top scores for flawless parking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.mp4?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic car physics</strong> \u2013 Feel the weight, speed, and handling of your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of unique challenges</strong> \u2013 From simple to mind-bending parking puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied environments</strong> \u2013 Suburbs, downtown traffic, and complex garages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple camera angles</strong> \u2013 Find the perfect view for precise parking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; reward system</strong> \u2013 Get rewarded for accuracy and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick play sessions</strong> \u2013 Perfect for short breaks or long play marathons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a parking pro or just learning to steer, this game delivers a satisfying mix of skill, strategy, and fun \u2014 without the stress of real-world traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the <strong>king of car parking</strong>?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Gear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958150/cd1032bebdfee0033ff3b515b015bfc379591291.jpg"},{"name":"Parking Prodigy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958150/4d49e1258f661e289a7d5d19fdc5da68f89359dc.jpg"},{"name":"Driving License","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958150/760cde5dd30f1e398ee47b6c434faf00ac5a9d14.jpg"},{"name":"No Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958150/afaf1e0a058109159cb91e45cb4a09dc52089332.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958150?t=1764037397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958150?t=1764037397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/8b68875997d07229ef856da91d55bd1883fa21c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764037397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/8b68875997d07229ef856da91d55bd1883fa21c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764037397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you park perfectly?</strong><br>Put your driving precision to the ultimate test in this fun and challenging car parking game. Navigate tight spaces, dodge obstacles, and master smooth, realistic driving controls as you guide your car into the perfect spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/e5a4c31590118736c930179dbf194e9d.mp4?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet suburban lots to busy city streets and multi-level garages, every level offers a new challenge that will test your steering skills and timing. Squeeze through narrow gaps, avoid collisions, and earn top scores for flawless parking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.poster.avif?t=1764037397\" width=780 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.webm?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/extras/24180a8fb421d36d7496971fc4126f27.mp4?t=1764037397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic car physics</strong> \u2013 Feel the weight, speed, and handling of your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of unique challenges</strong> \u2013 From simple to mind-bending parking puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied environments</strong> \u2013 Suburbs, downtown traffic, and complex garages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple camera angles</strong> \u2013 Find the perfect view for precise parking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; reward system</strong> \u2013 Get rewarded for accuracy and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick play sessions</strong> \u2013 Perfect for short breaks or long play marathons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a parking pro or just learning to steer, this game delivers a satisfying mix of skill, strategy, and fun \u2014 without the stress of real-world traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the <strong>king of car parking</strong>?</p>","developers":["Northshore Press LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958150/e3af4db6